{"ID":"20240513083317-98mmzde","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083317-98mmzde","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083317-98mmzde\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113740-in4kcwk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113740-in4kcwk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:494,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513113740-in4kcwk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:420,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:420\u0026#125;","title":"093","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123516"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513113740-in4kcwk","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 894px;","id":"20240513113740-in4kcwk","updated":"20240515123516"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"倪醫師病案紀錄    初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"073-4 L, L"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"17歲，瘦小"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080508"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. Angelman syndrome"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. Seizure(Angelman syndrome中有大於80%的小朋友會在3歲之前發作)，二、三年前開始服用西藥(Depakine, Klonopin)後，病人變得更昏睡、流口水，且仍有大發作。已開始減西藥量。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 服前方後，此星期狀況不佳，痙攣發作，抖動嚴重"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→建議喝濃蔗糖水、或黃色水果(木瓜、香蕉，含鉀多可助止痙攣，而且軟軟的也好吞)，以緩筋急。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 仍無胃口"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→西藥退癮的影響"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 服藥後吐出許多痰"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 曾打針止痙後，月經就不來"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→目前胃口不好、營養不足，因此奶水不夠而無月經。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 師曰: 此人仍有抖動，蔗糖水只止抽筋，抖動為痰飲造成，並非癲癇(看似癲癇)。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仍為藜蘆甘草湯證，及小建中湯證"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同4/30方 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六碗煮二碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各半碗  每服加麥芽糖一茶匙"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高脂、低糖(嚴格控制醣類)、低蛋白飲食即為”生酮飲食”，用於飲食控制癲癇病症，最早於西元前五世紀(新約聖經)即有記載”斷食”治療兒童癲癇病症，其特色為: 生酮飲食中，80％至90％的熱量要由脂肪提供。脂肪熱量比碳水化合物與蛋白質熱量總合的比值應為3:1至4:1。總而言之，就是利用持續維持體內”酮性”來改善癲癇病症，至於機轉西醫研究尚未明確，其解釋為：”酮體應該是生酮飲食治療機轉上的最大功臣：它提供了腦內神經細胞的額外能源，並製造了較多的穩定性神經傳導物質。”所以，要嚴格控制任何會反制酮體產生的因素(如: 醣類)，也因此，可能先出現低血糖、酸中毒、電解質不平衡、拉肚子、便秘、腹痛、倦怠及厭食等副作用。若使用生酮飲食三個月後，改善不超過50%，就停止。"}]}]}]}]}